{"data":[{"created_at":"2026-10-25T13:43:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114352058577117439"],"id":"2114352058577117439","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":138,"impression_count":62454,"like_count":62,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":19},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114340452870836238","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"没想到开发挺顺利，搞好了。\n\n开源地址：\nhttps://t.co/0Wu7z0z0MO\n\n如果你有旧的 Kindle，可按这个简化教程搞\n\n1.  京东到家买一个绿联的 type-c 转 micro-usb 线，好像20 多块，一小时送到家。\n\n2. 用数据线连上 Kindle，跟 Codex 说：“帮我越狱 kindle”。（如果拒换DeepSeek ）\n\n3.","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114352058577117439"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2114339715747033088","3_2114340337061924864","3_2114340337066082304","3_2114340337061883904"]},"created_at":"2026-10-25T12:57:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114340452870836238"],"id":"2114340452870836238","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":230,"impression_count":24820,"like_count":244,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":79,"retweet_count":26},"text":"跟大家同步下 Kindle  刷机改造进展。\n\n1. 增加了 AI RSS 订阅。\n2. 更方便美观的排版设置。\n3. 一句话下载发送电子书到 Kindle，不用 USB 线。\n4. 手机打开浏览器配置 API key\n\n基于 KOReader + SimpleUI 改造，等完成后开源。 https://t.co/Z3r5hiukfE","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114340452870836238"},{"created_at":"2026-10-25T07:43:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114261636722946473"],"id":"2114261636722946473","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":23,"impression_count":34982,"like_count":134,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":51,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113825585634168920","type":"quoted"}],"text":"记得那年还在字节GenAI部门做产品经理。\n\n某次双月会看到过guko视频模型的第一个Demo效果，感觉挺好。\n\n然后再没看到过更新...  后来才知道模型训练被人搞破坏。\n\n在字节，工作半年没任何产出，发现是被人搞了，搁谁受得了。 https://t.co/gOkxo9HOvm","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114261636722946473"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T14:14:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113997599644823757"],"id":"2113997599644823757","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":75,"impression_count":6523,"like_count":44,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":7},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113997354655465727","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"基于 SimpleUI 微调的界面，开源地址\n\nhttps://t.co/0Wu7z0z0MO","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113997599644823757"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2113996309275545601"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T14:13:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113997354655465727"],"id":"2113997354655465727","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":622,"impression_count":53938,"like_count":509,"quote_count":9,"reply_count":99,"retweet_count":69},"text":"越狱后的旧 Kindle 是最好的电子书阅读硬件！\n价格便宜续航久。\n\n装 KOReader + 微信读书插件，界面不满意可装 SimpleUI，也能 codex 或 claude code 随便改。\n\n刚把  乔木 Read Obsidian 插件加上发送到 Kindle 功能。\n\n支持原生 kindle 和 KOreader 系统。 https://t.co/mhxqegZ0dr","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113997354655465727"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113957592028569601"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T11:36:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113957797268533409"],"id":"2113957797268533409","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":106,"impression_count":14113,"like_count":86,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":37,"retweet_count":16},"text":"插件下载增长速度还挺快，已经 3000 用户了。\n\n以后听播客，看视频，做笔记都可以用 AI 辅助了。\n\nhttps://t.co/bDrLuRNAev https://t.co/VvBBTpxj2t","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113957797268533409"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113936269235634177"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T10:13:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113936883394937223"],"id":"2113936883394937223","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":75,"impression_count":11478,"like_count":72,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":5},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113918788018262446","type":"quoted"}],"text":"给Qiaomu Reader Obsidian 插件加了个功能，右键通过 Wifi 发送 epub 给越狱后的 kindle。\n\n加上自用 ebook MCP，实现一句话找书传 kindle。\n\n亚马逊退出中国后，泡面伴侣焕发新生机。 https://t.co/hQ1cCnnj2w https://t.co/qEh4YgwTNJ","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113936883394937223"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113918777809403905"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T09:01:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113918788018262446"],"id":"2113918788018262446","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":820,"impression_count":173153,"like_count":785,"quote_count":24,"reply_count":137,"retweet_count":79},"text":"现在越狱kindle太方便，京东买一根type-c 转micro-usb（老安卓常用）的数据线。\n\n连上Mac，让任意一个大模型处理就行。\n\n越狱后打算好好用AI改造下，做一个AI阅读器。 https://t.co/3Cvx7nRsff","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113918788018262446"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113832122108817408"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T03:17:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113832134410682569"],"id":"2113832134410682569","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":6530,"like_count":25,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113813688843120642","type":"quoted"}],"text":"AI时代有一个被忽略的工具，就是AI训练和AI应用爬虫的统计。\n\n今晚我会和姚老师一起直播，与北京日报一起开源GEO流量统计系统。\n\n扫码预约，直播间一起聊。 https://t.co/zXOCW3vNE4 https://t.co/WKzXAc0JaX","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113832134410682569"},{"created_at":"2026-10-23T16:09:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113664208059720053"],"id":"2113664208059720053","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":31,"impression_count":20856,"like_count":43,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":43,"retweet_count":1},"text":"今天录制「NextToken」播客，聊完买了 1Password。\n\n最近 php 漏洞，发现好像是 8 月份，前段时间泄露后，估计很多网站已经被黑过了。\n\n需换一批密码，打算用Chrome 和Apple自动生成的密码，不自己设了。\n\n1Password也与时俱进，有 CLI、有 MCP，Agent 友好。\n\n好像也有开源工具，但懒得折腾了。","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113664208059720053"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113656505304248321"]},"created_at":"2026-10-23T15:39:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113653841032077514","2113656348366008723","2113656514510807297"],"id":"2113656514510807297","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":262,"impression_count":30094,"like_count":150,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":33,"retweet_count":23},"text":"今天 歸藏(https://t.co/cmeQIg1O7i) @op7418 给我推荐的游戏Poke Bonk。\n\n个人 AI  Coding  出来的网页游戏。\n\n看了下虎嗅的介绍，很早营收已经过 2 亿...  真牛逼~\n\n据说点进去玩一会儿就上瘾。\n\nhttps://t.co/YiR4j9MYb0 https://t.co/U3bhSoDtjs","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113656514510807297"},{"created_at":"2026-10-23T06:15:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids"