/jG3x7H2qmY https://t.co/ukGm8u2Xm7","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113210728580857908"},{"created_at":"2026-10-22T09:54:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113207458189705483"],"id":"2113207458189705483","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":27,"impression_count":15855,"like_count":28,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113085471081345288","type":"quoted"}],"text":"腾讯 GEO 团队只做工具，定位清晰。\n相信腾讯的产品能力。\n\n最近很多大厂拜访交流， GEO 营销的生态越来越好了。 https://t.co/iBx5bFoNM7","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113207458189705483"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113073864351875072"]},"created_at":"2026-10-22T01:04:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113073886527123922"],"id":"2113073886527123922","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":3307,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113073882865557965","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"模型使用 记忆原生 MoE 构架。\n历史信息会被编码为持续存在、可更新的内部记忆状态，记忆写入、保持、更新、读取全纳入模型计算过程。\n\n在内部记忆基础上，通过真实任务中交互、指导和纠错反馈积累经验。\n\n直接收益就是让模型具备自我反思、自我进化能力，让长程任务保持一致、不跑偏。\n\n这对AI Coding https://t.co/Zesl1dZ2zi","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113073886527123922"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113073483181932544"]},"created_at":"2026-10-22T01:04:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113073882865557965"],"id":"2113073882865557965","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":74,"impression_count":12385,"like_count":99,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":70,"retweet_count":10},"text":"我去，这个大模型有点意思啊！\nMemT 1.0 ：全球首个\"记忆原生\"  大模型（MoE构架）\n\n现在 ChatGPT 、Claude Codex 都支持记忆，但都记在模型外部（记忆库/对话历史），用时检索注入上下文。\n\n记忆来源于用户要求和对话自动保存，记再多，模型本身不会变，只是能看到更多信息。\n\nMemT 1.0 https://t.co/N0xXK8Hg9D","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113073882865557965"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112945263983902720"]},"created_at":"2026-10-21T16:36:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112946015242477909"],"id":"2112946015242477909","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":4925,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_cou